{"version":1,"content":"<p>內蒙古呼倫貝爾市疾控中心早前發布鼠疫防控風險提示，引發網民關注。</p><p>當地衛健委昨日（13日）澄清，呼倫貝爾並未出現鼠疫疫情，有關提示僅屬例行科普宣傳，現已刪除，以免引起公眾誤解。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.651621+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:40:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:39.903683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416450+00:00","content_hash":"5c6e7c0ef477e5ede9ebc9376ceabdb2488c06152d12b8cb28df05682511c4c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}